      "problem": "Given that $y=4\\operatorname{ln}⁡x+{x}^{\\sqrt{5}}+7$, find $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}.$\n\n$\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=$ \n{{field-1}}",
